<h3>About Open Textbook Collaborative: Career and Technical Education</h3>

<p>The Open Textbook Collaborative (OTC) is a&nbsp;community college-led, statewide collaborative program in New Jersey to fill an important need for open textbooks and other learning resources. OER developed for the OTC was funded by the <a href="https://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/ope/fipse/index.html">Fund for the Improvement of Postsecondary Education</a> (FIPSE) of the U.S. Department of Education for the Open Textbooks Pilot grant. The grant runs through 2023.&nbsp; For more information, go to our&nbsp;<a href="https://middlesexcc.libguides.com/OTCProject/home" target="_blank">Open Textbook Collaborative website.</a>&nbsp;To propose and develop OER for this collection,&nbsp;visit our <a href="https://middlesexcc.libguides.com/OTCProject/curriculum" target="_blank">curriculum</a>&nbsp;and <a href="https://middlesexcc.libguides.com/OTCProject/apply">course proposal </a>pages.</p>

